{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drilly is a dedicated worker robot from the Cyberion cluster of planets. A world inhabited by an advanced being called the &quot;Cyber \u200b\u200bMother&quot; who maintains order and guides all robots towards a future of teamwork and harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Cyber \u200b\u200bMother fails and falls silent, a subtle mental corruption sets in. Military organizations, gangs, and crazy defenders vie for control, and Drilly must drill his way to the bottom of the world in search of answers before everything falls apart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drill Hero Legend is a 2D action-platformer with rogue-lite elements, where your drill head is your greatest weapon! Drill, shoot, and glide at high speeds as you face intense challenges! Choose your route, overcome obstacles with unique advantages and disadvantages, and upgrade your arsenal.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754280/extras/2167af3b0bd55fbdc35f02acdabca77c.poster.avif?t=1768317610\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754280/extras/2167af3b0bd55fbdc35f02acdabca77c.webm?t=1768317610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754280/extras/2167af3b0bd55fbdc35f02acdabca77c.mp4?t=1768317610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every time you are destroyed, your body is rebuilt in its original factory blueprint, but your resources are retained. Before each match, you can exchange these resources for a random selection of upgrades, drills, and outfits. The offer changes each time you return, ensuring that each match begins with new possibilities and unique strategies!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754280/extras/464799df68904f835a3d2277d056367f.poster.avif?t=1768317610\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754280/extras/464799df68904f835a3d2277d056367f.webm?t=1768317610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754280/extras/464799df68904f835a3d2277d056367f.mp4?t=1768317610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754280/extras/c2e45012afa3c8303bfd3fd183a3566a.poster.avif?t=1768317610\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754280/extras/c2e45012afa3c8303bfd3fd183a3566a.webm?t=1768317610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754280/extras/c2e45012afa3c8303bfd3fd183a3566a.mp4?t=1768317610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Highlights:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize attributes and skills! Collect resources and buy various goods. Drills, outfits, and special weapons with unique shots to adapt your hero to your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temporal anomalies change your routes! Explore different areas of the stage by choosing between three distinct routes each round. Anomalies can bring you benefits or additional challenges, such as increased damage or loss of your total life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your drill head in many ways! Use your powerful drill to propel yourself into the air in different directions, attack enemies, and drill through platforms to traverse easier paths.  </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2754280?t=1768317610","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768317610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754280/0d9b7cb33c64be8a98502b578cdb5206ac3ddc12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768317610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754280/0d9b7cb33c64be8a98502b578cdb5206ac3ddc12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768317610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drilly is a dedicated worker robot from the Cyberion cluster of planets. A world inhabited by an advanced being called the &quot;Cyber \u200b\u200bMother&quot; who maintains order and guides all robots towards a future of teamwork and harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Cyber \u200b\u200bMother fails and falls silent, a subtle mental corruption sets in. Military organizations, gangs, and crazy defenders vie for control, and Drilly must drill his way to the bottom of the world in search of answers before everything falls apart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drill Hero Legend is a 2D action-platformer with rogue-lite elements, where your drill head is your greatest weapon! Drill, shoot, and glide at high speeds as you face intense challenges! Choose your route, overcome obstacles with unique advantages and disadvantages, and upgrade your arsenal.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754280/extras/2167af3b0bd55fbdc35f02acdabca77c.poster.avif?t=1768317610\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\